---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from './PageHeader.astro';
import Callout from './Callout.astro';
import CodeBlock from './CodeBlock.astro';

interface Props { lang: 'en' | 'id' }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const id = lang === 'id';
---

<DocsLayout title="Deployment">
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Docker / GHCR"
    title={id ? 'Deployment production' : 'Production deployment'}
    description={id ? 'Image production menggabungkan backend Express dan build React menjadi satu container non-root. Stock Compose sengaja tidak memerlukan file environment dan mem-publish service hanya ke loopback host.' : 'The production image combines the Express backend and compiled React frontend into one non-root container. Stock Compose intentionally requires no environment file and publishes the service only to host loopback.'}
  />

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-3">GHCR</h2>
  <CodeBlock label="image" code={`ghcr.io/howlil/wago-simple:latest\nghcr.io/howlil/wago-simple:main\nghcr.io/howlil/wago-simple:sha-<short-sha>`} />
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed mb-8">{id ? 'Nama image wago-simple dipertahankan sebagai identifier distribusi saat ini meskipun repository bernama howlil/wago. Workflow release membangun linux/amd64 dan linux/arm64, menghasilkan SBOM/provenance, lalu push manifest ke GHCR.' : 'The wago-simple image name remains the current distribution identifier even though the repository is howlil/wago. The release workflow builds linux/amd64 and linux/arm64, generates SBOM/provenance, and pushes the manifest to GHCR.'}</p>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-3">Docker Compose</h2>
  <CodeBlock label="shell" code={`git clone https://github.com/howlil/wago.git\ncd wago\ndocker compose pull\ndocker compose up -d\ndocker compose ps\ncurl http://127.0.0.1:3000/health`} />
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-4">{id ? 'Tidak ada .env yang wajib untuk stock Compose. Fresh persistent volume menggunakan first-run dashboard bootstrap untuk membuat credential gateway.' : 'No .env file is required for stock Compose. A fresh persistent volume uses first-run dashboard bootstrap to create gateway credentials.'}</p>
  <Callout title={id ? 'Network default sengaja tetap' : 'Network default is intentionally fixed'}>
    {id ? 'Compose mem-publish 127.0.0.1:3000. Letakkan Caddy, Nginx, Traefik, Cloudflare Tunnel, atau router PaaS di depannya dan gunakan HTTPS ketika service diakses di luar localhost.' : 'Compose publishes 127.0.0.1:3000. Put Caddy, Nginx, Traefik, Cloudflare Tunnel, or a PaaS router in front of it and use HTTPS when the service is accessed outside localhost.'}
  </Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">{id ? 'Pre-provisioned API key opsional' : 'Optional pre-provisioned API key'}</h2>
  <CodeBlock label="container environment" code={`API_KEY=<long-random-secret>`} />
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-4">{id ? 'Runtime menerima API_KEY bila deployment platform atau custom Compose override menyediakannya. File docker-compose.yml bawaan tidak meneruskan environment ini karena default deployment menggunakan browser bootstrap.' : 'The runtime accepts API_KEY when your deployment platform or custom Compose override provides it. The bundled docker-compose.yml does not forward this environment value because the default deployment uses browser bootstrap.'}</p>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">{id ? 'Hardening container' : 'Container hardening'}</h2>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] space-y-2 mb-8">
    <li>{id ? 'Runtime berjalan sebagai user node, bukan root.' : 'Runtime runs as the node user, not root.'}</li>
    <li>{id ? 'Root filesystem read-only; /tmp memakai tmpfs.' : 'Read-only root filesystem with /tmp on tmpfs.'}</li>
    <li>{id ? 'Semua Linux capabilities di-drop.' : 'All Linux capabilities are dropped.'}</li>
    <li><code>no-new-privileges:true</code></li>
    <li>{id ? 'Data persisten hanya melalui named volume wago_data.' : 'Persistent data goes through the wago_data named volume.'}</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-3">{id ? 'Reverse proxy, TLS, dan origin' : 'Reverse proxy, TLS, and origin'}</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed mb-4">{id ? 'Gunakan satu origin HTTPS untuk dashboard dan API bila memungkinkan. Wago tidak memiliki configurable CORS allowlist. Production bootstrap memvalidasi bahwa Origin menggunakan HTTPS dan host Origin sama dengan Host request; state-changing cookie-authenticated requests juga menolak origin yang tidak sama.' : 'Prefer one HTTPS origin for both dashboard and API. Wago does not expose a configurable CORS allowlist. Production bootstrap validates that Origin uses HTTPS and the Origin host matches the request Host; state-changing cookie-authenticated requests also reject a mismatched origin.'}</p>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">Persistence</h2>
  <div class="border border-[#262626] rounded-lg divide-y divide-[#262626] text-sm mb-8">
    <div class="p-4"><code class="text-[#fafafa]">/app/data/wago.db</code><p class="text-[#71717a] mt-1">{id ? 'SQLite application state: App ID/API-key hash, binding, recipient policy, outbound safety, migration metadata, dan structured audit event.' : 'SQLite application state: App ID/API-key hash, binding, recipient policy, outbound safety, migration metadata, and structured audit events.'}</p></div>
    <div class="p-4"><code class="text-[#fafafa]">/app/data/wago.db-wal</code> / <code class="text-[#fafafa]">wago.db-shm</code><p class="text-[#71717a] mt-1">{id ? 'File runtime SQLite saat WAL mode aktif. Jangan dipisahkan dari database ketika mengambil snapshot live.' : 'SQLite runtime files while WAL mode is active. Do not separate them from the database when taking a live snapshot.'}</p></div>
    <div class="p-4"><code class="text-[#fafafa]">/app/data/auth/</code><p class="text-[#71717a] mt-1">{id ? 'Baileys multi-file credential/session state. Perlakukan seperti private key.' : 'Baileys multi-file credential/session state. Treat it like a private key.'}</p></div>
  </div>

  <Callout title={id ? 'Yang tetap transient' : 'What remains transient'} tone="warning">
    {id ? 'Current QR/connection/reconnect state, account-health cache, recent-message content, dan message-status cache dibangun ulang setelah proses restart. Recipient policy, outbound safety, binding, dan audit state tetap durable di SQLite.' : 'Current QR/connection/reconnect state, the account-health cache, recent-message content, and message-status cache are rebuilt after restart. Recipient policy, outbound safety, binding, and audit state remain durable in SQLite.'}
  </Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">{id ? 'WhatsApp Web version saat pairing' : 'WhatsApp Web version during pairing'}</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-8">{id ? 'Ketika membuat socket baru, Wago mencoba resolve versi WhatsApp Web terbaru melalui Baileys. Versi live yang berhasil di-resolve di-cache selama proses berjalan. Jika lookup gagal, lifecycle melanjutkan socket creation dengan versi default/bundled Baileys agar pairing tidak bergantung pada satu remote lookup.' : 'When creating a new socket, Wago attempts to resolve the latest WhatsApp Web version through Baileys. A successfully resolved live version is cached for the process lifetime. If lookup fails, the lifecycle continues socket creation with the Baileys default/bundled version so pairing does not depend on a single remote lookup.'}</p>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-3">{id ? 'Upgrade dari JSON store lama' : 'Upgrade from the legacy JSON store'}</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-8">{id ? 'Pada startup pertama setelah upgrade, Wago mengimpor app settings, WhatsApp binding, recipients, outbound policy, dan activity log lama ke wago.db dalam satu transaksi. Import ditandai di database sehingga tidak dijalankan ulang. File JSON lama tidak dihapus otomatis agar tetap tersedia sebagai recovery artifact.' : 'On the first startup after upgrading, Wago imports legacy app settings, WhatsApp binding, recipients, outbound policy, and activity log into wago.db in one transaction. The database records an import marker so the migration is not repeated. Legacy JSON files are not deleted automatically and remain available as recovery artifacts.'}</p>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-3">Backup</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-4">{id ? 'Untuk snapshot filesystem paling sederhana, hentikan service agar SQLite checkpoint selesai sebelum volume diarsipkan.' : 'For the simplest filesystem snapshot, stop the service so SQLite can checkpoint before archiving the volume.'}</p>
  <CodeBlock label="shell" code={`docker compose stop wago\nVOLUME=$(docker inspect "$(docker compose ps -aq wago)" --format '{{range .Mounts}}{{if eq .Destination "/app/data"}}{{.Name}}{{end}}{{end}}')\nmkdir -p backups\ndocker run --rm \\\n  -v "$VOLUME:/data:ro" \\\n  -v "$PWD/backups:/backup" \\\n  alpine:3.22 tar -C /data -czf /backup/wago-data.tgz .\nchmod 600 backups/wago-data.tgz\ndocker compose start wago`} />
  <Callout title={id ? 'Jangan hapus volume saat upgrade' : 'Do not delete the volume during upgrades'} tone="danger">
    {id ? 'docker compose down -v menghapus named volume dan dapat menghilangkan database, pairing state, gateway settings, recipient records, outbound safety state, dan audit log.' : 'docker compose down -v removes the named volume and can delete the database, pairing state, gateway settings, recipient records, outbound safety state, and audit log.'}
  </Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">Upgrade</h2>
  <CodeBlock label="shell" code={`docker compose pull\ndocker compose up -d`} />
  <p class="text-sm text-[#71717a]">{id ? 'Compose default memakai latest. Untuk deployment reproducible, edit image tag di docker-compose.yml ke release atau sha-* yang diinginkan.' : 'Compose defaults to latest. For a reproducible deployment, edit the image tag in docker-compose.yml to the desired release or sha-* tag.'}</p>
</DocsLayout>
